# Paths kept out of every prepared run. Prep drops them before hunks.txt is written, so the
# narrating agent cannot see them and no chapter can cite them — keep this list to material a
# reviewer would genuinely skip, not merely material that is large.

# Machine-readable dumps rather than authored code.
*.jsonl

# Vendored design-tool bundles: generated HTML and support scripts we do not write or review.
# The authored brief beside them, docs/design-briefs/<date>-<slug>.md, stays in scope.
docs/design-briefs/*/
